Again, touching on something similar to what Tim Ferriss did—what it is that successful people are doing.

49
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,375
他们能成功自有原因。
There’s a reason they’re successful.

50
00:02:30,375 --> 00:02:32,555
他们确实有很多共同的特质。
They all do tend to have some common characteristics.

51
00:02:32,555 --> 00:02:37,399
既然这样，我们就必须搞清楚这些特质是什么，并且确保自己也养成它们。
